      "$t": "<div style=\"display: none;\">\n  <summary>\n    Za konec tedna v Avstrijo, saj v Karnijcih divja obsežen požar, in sicer na\n    pobočjih Amariane.\n  </summary>\n</div>\n\n<span><a name='more'></a></span>\n\n<div style=\"display: none;\">\n  <!--Hidden cover photo-->\n</div>\n\n<span>\n  <!--Lightbox settings:\n  * photo title -> after <a insert atribut: data-title=\"My image\"\n  * make more separate photo rolls -> after <a insert changed atribut: data-lightbox=\"Galery\"-->\n</span>\n\n<a\n  href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi3eLjav6Uu5MCpgjZpvURlZZEW4wj3zOmatI_sYx9_JENm_M7TkOqPEL9SKWbtqoBeTuBgSUxA_1b-cvO3E42Vt9UuckSyoGIZZtj_QcojxYuKtXg7IkfCMkxqnRjfHCpPtp3KHIXQvkpW3QZFRSgxRogl3yI-8xIsaxN4IMMhGqF0XK9uQMEPBtUWJ5U/s1600/20260815_172707687.JPG\"\n  style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"\n  ><img\n    alt=\"\"\n    border=\"0\"\n    data-original-height=\"3000\"\n    data-original-width=\"4000\"\n    data-skip=\"1;2;cover\"\n    src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi3eLjav6Uu5MCpgjZpvURlZZEW4wj3zOmatI_sYx9_JENm_M7TkOqPEL9SKWbtqoBeTuBgSUxA_1b-cvO3E42Vt9UuckSyoGIZZtj_QcojxYuKtXg7IkfCMkxqnRjfHCpPtp3KHIXQvkpW3QZFRSgxRogl3yI-8xIsaxN4IMMhGqF0XK9uQMEPBtUWJ5U/s1200/20260815_172707687.JPG\"\n    width=\"800\"\n/></a>\n\n<!--Line break-->\n<hr />\n\n<div class=\"peak-tag\"></div>\n<br /><b><span style=\"font-size: 25px;\">Za vikend v Avstrijo</span></b\n><br /><br />\n\n<!--Content-->\n<p>\n  Prvoten plan za vikend so bili sicer Karnijci, a je zaradi obsežnega požara,\n  ki divja na pobočjih Amariane prišlo spremembe. Tako je bila prvi dan na vrsti\n  Hochalmspitze (3360&nbsp;m), drug dan pa Dobrač (2166&nbsp;m), in sicer s\n  severne strani po manj obiskanih poteh. Vreme je bilo sončno, temperature pa\n  verjetno bolj prijetne, kot bi bile v Karnijcih.\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"separator\" style=\"display: none;\"><b>1. dan</b></p>\n\n<div class=\